- **Arch-4 (V1S-86):** Trigger orchestration interface — [`orchestrationSeam.ts`](convex/orchestrationSeam.ts) HTTP paths, [`orchestrationCore.ts`](convex/orchestrationCore.ts) keys/status, [`orchestrationState.ts`](convex/orchestrationState.ts) lease mutations. `triggerDispatch` stays the SDK layer. Payloads unchanged; redeploy Trigger workers after merging seam imports (`bun run trigger:deploy`).
