- **Matt Pocock agent setup:** `docs/agents/issue-tracker.md` (GitHub/`gh`), `docs/agents/domain.md` (single-context); `## Agent skills` in [`AGENTS.md`](AGENTS.md). No triage labels until `triage` skill is installed.
