## 2026-07-05

- **Auth UI**: Removed Google/GitHub sign-in buttons from [`SignInForm`](src/SignInForm.tsx); OAuth env vars are not configured. Email/password and guest sign-in remain. Backend OAuth providers stay in [`convex/auth.ts`](convex/auth.ts) for future enablement.
- **Deck composer persistence**: [`decks.update`](convex/decks.ts) saves composer state (blocks, palette, scroll FX, overlay, typography, slides) to Convex with debounced autosave + **Saving… / Saved** indicator in [`DeckComposer`](src/components/deck/DeckComposer.tsx); legacy `localStorage` is a UI-only cache for selection index.
- **Image delete/edit auth**: [`images.remove`](convex/images.ts) / **`removeMany`** / **`updateImageMetadata`** require **`uploadedBy === userId`** or admin (`ADMIN_USER_IDS` / `ADMIN_EMAILS` env); shared active library images are no longer deletable by any signed-in user.
- **HTTP security**: [`/smartAnalyzeImage`](convex/vision.ts) requires **`INGEST_API_KEY`** Bearer auth and verifies image ownership before scheduling analysis.
- **Lineage**: [`getLineage`](convex/images.ts) returns parent/children for **active library** images, not owner-only.
- **Library query**: Gallery + Table share one **`images.list` limit 1000** subscription from [`App.tsx`](src/App.tsx).
- **App shell**: top-level **`AppErrorBoundary`**; **⌘K** focuses search; removed dead Topbar Filters/Sort buttons.

